          "bullets": [
            "Citing Bloomberg, DCD reports Oracle sent a force majeure notice to Blue Owl Capital \"in an effort to shield itself from potential increased costs\"; should the 2.5GW campus fail to come online in 2028 as planned, Oracle is seeking to delay payments rather than forfeit its tenancy.",
            "The 1,400-acre campus is to span four data centre buildings, built by Stack and BorderPlex Digital Assets, which previously announced plans to invest up to $165 billion in the project. Oracle was named as tenant in January 2026; Blue Owl acquired Stack Infrastructure in 2024.",
