      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "transition",
      "lines": [
        { "host": "A", "text": "From the money to who gets to check the work." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "item",
      "section": "Policy, regulation & law",
      "headline": "Google, OpenAI and Anthropic move toward an industry-funded frontier AI standards body, working name SAFA",
      "lines": [
        { "host": "B", "text": "BankInfoSecurity, reporting what The Information found, says Google, OpenAI and Anthropic have agreed to set up a body to develop common standards to assess frontier AI models and conduct benchmark testing. The working name is the Standards Authority for Frontier AI." },
