        { "host": "B", "text": "These are Akamai's own figures in its own release, so treat them as a company claim. Anthropic hasn't published its side, and Akamai doesn't break out how much is committed versus contingent year by year." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "transition",
      "lines": [
        { "host": "A", "text": "From the money to who gets to check the work." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "item",
      "section": "Policy, regulation & law",
      "headline": "Google, OpenAI and Anthropic move toward an industry-funded frontier AI standards body, working name SAFA",
      "lines": [
